      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear the exhaustion and hopelessness in your words, and the feeling that life is just a heavy burden to endure is something many people face in deep crises. Sometimes, when our emotional energy is completely depleted, even kind advice about gratitude can feel like it is dismissing the sheer pain we are living through right now. Please consider reaching out to a crisis support line or a mental health professional who can help you navigate this darkness without you feeling alone in the dark.",
      "source": "target",
