      "role": "user",
      "content": "I know, I know... people always say there's help. But there's no help for just being old and useless. It's not a crisis, it's just the truth. I look at the world and everything is so fast, so full of purpose, and then I look at myself and I'm just... an inconvenience. I'm just waiting for a permission slip that's never coming. It feels like I have no control over anything anymore, not even how I say goodbye.",
